strings |id, value|

bug_descriptions |bug_id, line_num, content|
    web_render_k4_button_follower_pen_from_device_width_2026-11-28, 0, "At device scale k > 1 the pen after an inline auto-width <button> is taken from the button's device-snapped width (inline_item_width_err_milli: box_device_extra_w_at(c) x 1000 / k); Chrome 159 starts the next item at the button's LayoutUnit width (label advance rounded up to 1/64 device px, plus padding and border). The origin of the text that follows is therefore off by a fraction of a device px, and its glyphs that sit on a quarter-device-px tie take either phase depending on sub-milli changes upstream."
    web_render_k4_button_follower_pen_from_device_width_2026-11-28, 1, "Seen on catalog forms-media at k=4: <button>Exercise controls</button> <output>Not exercised</output>. Band y=1360..1440 device px against Chrome: 1526 mismatching px at 199527f4aef, 1947 with the inline item LayoutUnit ceil (the space item after the button went from 4445 to 4446 milli-px, true value 4445.3125). The page stays at 0.05."

bugs_active |id, severity, status, title, file, line, reproducible_by, created_at, updated_at, valid|
    web_render_k4_button_follower_pen_from_device_width_2026-11-28, P3, open, "web render: text after an inline button at k > 1 starts from the button's device-snapped width, not its LayoutUnit width", src/lib/gc_async_mut/gpu/browser_engine/simple_web_html_layout_renderer_layout_foundation.spl, 1832, "catalog forms-media at --device-scale 4, rows 1360..1440 (Not exercised)", 2026-11-28, 2026-11-28, true

bug_investigation_logs |bug_id, line_num, content|
    web_render_k4_button_follower_pen_from_device_width_2026-11-28, 0, "2026-11-28 inline-ceil lane: found while measuring the item ceil. Not measured in Chrome: the button's getBoundingClientRect width at k=4. Fix sketch: carry the button's exact LayoutUnit width (label width_q20 at the device font size) past it instead of the device-snapped box."
